WEBVTT

00:03:55.566 --> 00:04:01.566
we plan to have one reporter in each
of the 5,500 subdistricts in India,

00:04:01.590 --> 00:04:03.169
covering the entire nation,

00:04:04.540 --> 00:04:09.958
to ensure that none
of these important stories go unnoticed.

00:04:13.832 --> 00:04:17.221
Next time you see
a story from the countryside,

00:04:17.245 --> 00:04:19.022
please do not ignore it.

00:04:19.499 --> 00:04:22.738
Do read and share them,
they might be breaking stories.

00:04:22.762 --> 00:04:24.659
This way, we can ensure

00:04:24.683 --> 00:04:27.619
none of the important
stories go unnoticed.

00:04:27.643 --> 00:04:28.793
Thank you.

00:04:28.817 --> 00:04:32.761
(Applause)